{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3486140/extras/1193c43ba2546cd92f0476ae886a5244.avif?t=1773664404\" width=650 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yuel\u2019s life was miserable. Though born into a wealthy family, Yuel\u2019s parents divorced when he was young and his father was cold and callous. Desperate to earn his father\u2019s affection (or, failing that, his approval), Yuel worked hard at university, studying for a degree he wasn\u2019t truly interested in\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Until his father\u2019s sudden death puts a wrench in Yuel\u2019s plans.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feeling lost and bereft, Yuel seeks help from his older cousin, Tavi, who agrees to take Yuel in while he\u2019s coming to terms with his father\u2019s death. This was only ever supposed to be a temporary arrangement, but feelings begin to grow between the two that are more than just familial.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now, with his father\u2019s funeral behind him and a hefty inheritance he\u2019s set to earn, Yuel must try to muddle along as best he can while living with Tavi.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It\u2019ll be a while until Yuel comes into his father\u2019s money, so until then, the two need to stay afloat as best they can, all while trying to maintain their unusual relationship. Will they be able to succeed, or will it end in disaster?<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3486140/extras/81bd32bc16f0a480e823c20212a549b8.avif?t=1773664404\" width=650 height=200 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A continuation of<i> Unluckily in Love</i> which picks up where the original VN left off</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Four cute slice of life stories which can be read in any order</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >200k of text (approx 8-15 hours of reading)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A slew of adorable artwork</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A cute gay romance story with an established couple</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A lively supporting cast</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Several brand new songs in the OST</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A handful of adult scenes which are all consensual in nature</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cute boys!!!</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Maid to Serve","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3486140/9ba5f5214072d6ab52adff3dd8ade7d80b14867f.jpg"},{"name":"Ancient History","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3486140/df0874f917ff8a330c98745c5ca34908957587fe.jpg"},{"name":"Cosy Camping","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3486140/e34df0ecb648fbf3aaf187e4b26375489dc36d69.jpg"},{"name":"Take the Wheel","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3486140/df8c047eab47ea213988124ee75f218d2728e870.jpg"}],"total":4},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3486140?t=1773664404","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3486140/61c4cf017a44d16b06a4a440061c6f9360bab5cc/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1773664404","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3486140/5cdcbac70fc042b0f7aeceb756b43eb6733708b8/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773664404","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3486140/5cdcbac70fc042b0f7aeceb756b43eb6733708b8/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773664404","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":6